<div align="left"><div align="left" style="font-size:14px;color:#3c4257">NOTICE-BODY Hello Pat, this is a short reminder that your Example Plan renews on 20 November 2026 and that the renewal charge of $12.00 will be taken from the card on file. If you would like to change your plan, update your payment details or cancel before the renewal date, you can do so at any time from your account settings page.</div></div>
